1. Dig out the walls of a vault and all the adjacent squares of rock.

2. Stand in the vault and wait for a guard to appear. Tell him your
name is Croesus (who has to be dead for this to work, so the guard
gets angry).

3. Kill the guard.

You get a message that "The corridor disappears." but none of the wall
or rock squares reappear.

There are three bugs on the list that mention vault guards, but none
of them look like this one - is this a new bug?

